1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,020
This free AI tool lets you turn any website

2
00:00:02,020 --> 00:00:04,040
into its own API, even if it doesn't have one.

3
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:06,120
So you no longer need to pay for scraping tools

4
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:08,259
or expensive APIs, even for gated websites

5
00:00:08,259 --> 00:00:09,679
like LinkedIn, Instagram, or Reddit.

6
00:00:09,839 --> 00:00:11,460
It's called Reverse API Engineer,

7
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:13,080
and it's a free and open source tool

8
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:14,699
that plugs straight into your cloud code.

9
00:00:14,839 --> 00:00:16,699
Just give it a website and tell it what data you want,

10
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:18,500
and an AI agent will browse that site,

11
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:20,539
read every request happening behind the scenes,

12
00:00:20,739 --> 00:00:22,679
and from that, build a clean API client

13
00:00:22,679 --> 00:00:24,719
that you can use to pull that data any time you want.

14
00:00:24,839 --> 00:00:26,120
Plus, since it uses the same API

15
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:27,539
that the site itself runs on,

16
00:00:27,579 --> 00:00:29,000
it doesn't break even when the website

17
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:30,059
changes its whole design.

18
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:31,160
So if you want to try it yourselves,

19
00:00:31,339 --> 00:00:33,320
just come in API, and I'll DM me the link directly.
